{"name":"Tell Me a Secret","hex":"#f0f3f1","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tell","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Mental senses related to determining, reckoning, or perceiving","To notice, discern. (Roughly, \"can tell\" means \"know\" but with a sense of direct perception.)"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A reflexive, often habitual behavior, especially one occurring in a context that often features attempts at deception by persons under psychological stress (such as a poker game or police interrogation), that reveals information that the person exhibiting the behavior is attempting to withhold.","A giveaway; something that unintentionally reveals or hints at a secret."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tell"},{"term":"secret","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The key or principle by which something is made clear; the knack."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep secret.","To hide secretly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tell Me a Secret","blocks":[{"text":"Tell Me a Secret is the fifth studio album by Australian jazz musician Vince Jones, released in November 1986."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/02/Tell_Me_a_Secret_by_Vince_Jones.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tell_Me_a_Secret","wikidata":"Q105605564"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/02/Tell_Me_a_Secret_by_Vince_Jones.png/250px-Tell_Me_a_Secret_by_Vince_Jones.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/02/Tell_Me_a_Secret_by_Vince_Jones.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wik